<h3>About Easy Read callout</h3>
<p>Finish each Easy Read content page with this callout. It explains the format and provides a route to more Easy Read articles without interrupting the main content.</p>
<p>Use the Easy Read icon in the callout to help people identify the format. The approved icon is available to <a href="https://branding.nsw.gov.au/asset-download/?id=ba697223-0548-41ea-97ad-a60e26834bb2" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">download from the NSW Government Branding Toolkit</a>.</p>
